	(text "Flash Using USB\n\nFor the ESP32-S3, the USB peripheral is available, allowing you to flash \nthe binaries without the need for an external USB-to-UART bridge.\n\nThe USB on the ESP32-S3 uses the GPIO20 for D+ and GPIO19 for D-.\n\nIf you are flashing for the first time, you need to get the ESP32-S3 \ninto the download mode manually. To do so, press and hold the BOOT button\nand then press the RESET button once. After that release the BOOT button.\n\nhttps://docs.espressif.com/projects/esp-idf/en/stable/esp32s3/get-started/establish-serial-connection.html"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 144.78 16.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14c23cfa-40d8-4783-9c94-f0e015b21147")
	)
